# Review routing for the MFFI portal.
#
# This file turns the editorial roles the project has informally into
# something mechanical: a pull request touching lipid parameters requests
# review from the lipid editors automatically, rather than waiting for
# somebody to notice it.
#
# NOTE: these teams must exist in the Martini-Force-Field-Initiative
# organisation. GitHub silently ignores CODEOWNERS entries naming a team 
# that does not exist, so an unreviewed pull request looks identical to a
# correctly-routed one. Create the teams before relying on this.

# Fallback owner for anything not matched below.
*                                           @Martini-Force-Field-Initiative/maintainers

# Content, routed by domain.
/docs/publications/                         @Martini-Force-Field-Initiative/publications-editors
/docs/announcements/                        @Martini-Force-Field-Initiative/communications-editors
/docs/tutorials/                            @Martini-Force-Field-Initiative/tutorials-editors
/docs/downloads/tools/                      @Martini-Force-Field-Initiative/tools-editors
/docs/downloads/force-field-parameters/     @Martini-Force-Field-Initiative/parameters-editors
/docs/downloads/example-applications/       @Martini-Force-Field-Initiative/parameters-editors
/docs/downloads/example-input-files/        @Martini-Force-Field-Initiative/parameters-editors
/docs/faq/                                  @Martini-Force-Field-Initiative/maintainers
/docs/contact/                              @Martini-Force-Field-Initiative/maintainers

# Infrastructure. Changes here affect every contribution type.
/_quarto.yml                                @Martini-Force-Field-Initiative/maintainers
/scripts/                                   @Martini-Force-Field-Initiative/maintainers
/.github/                                   @Martini-Force-Field-Initiative/maintainers
/js/                                        @Martini-Force-Field-Initiative/maintainers
/ejs/                                       @Martini-Force-Field-Initiative/maintainers
/styles.css                                 @Martini-Force-Field-Initiative/maintainers
/theme.scss                                 @Martini-Force-Field-Initiative/maintainers
